# Phone-hosted web env — lives at ~/eternyx-web/.env.web on the phone.
# NEVER commit the filled-in file. DASHBOARD_INGEST_KEY must be identical
# to the bot's key in ~/eternyx-bot/.env (the bot pushes to 127.0.0.1:3000).
# Generate keys: node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(24).toString('hex'))"
DASHBOARD_ACCESS_KEY=
DASHBOARD_INGEST_KEY=
